Child Safety & Community Guidelines for Umaji Raje
1. Introduction

उमाजी राजे(Umaji Raje) is committed to providing a safe and respectful environment for all users. Protecting children and preventing harmful content is our top priority.

2. Age Restrictions

This app is not intended for users under 13 years of age.

Users must confirm their age during registration.

Accounts of users found to be under the minimum age requirement will be removed.

3. User Safety Measures

We implement the following safety features:

Profile Moderation – All profiles and user content are reviewed.

Blocking & Reporting – Users can block or report others for inappropriate behavior or content.

Content Monitoring – We actively monitor for explicit content, harassment, and harmful interactions.

4. Prohibited Activities

The following are strictly prohibited:

Sharing of sexually explicit or harmful content.

Bullying, harassment, or threatening others.

Sharing personal information of minors.

Grooming or child exploitation in any form (zero tolerance).

5. Reporting Abuse

Users can report inappropriate content or behavior using:

In-app Report and Block options.

Contact us directly at [your email address].

Reports are reviewed promptly, and appropriate actions (including account suspension or banning) are taken.

6. Parental Guidance

Parents and guardians are encouraged to:

Monitor their child’s activity in the app.

Contact us if they believe their child’s account is active.

